{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And he who strikes (the life of) a beast shall make it good; and he who strikes a man shall be put to death.</b> And it juxtaposes to it 'one judgment,' teaching you that the law is equal in capital cases and in monetary cases with regard to examination and investigation. One judgment — the judgment of the One, the Holy One, blessed be He, who is One; that judgment which He gave to you at Mount Sinai, not like the judgments of the nations and their laws."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:28:07.644894930Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}